{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "[age](https://github.com/filosottile/age) is a modern and secure asymmetric encryption tool. When enabled, the zip file is encrypted with this project's public key so it can be posted publicly, e.g. in GitHub issues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[age](https://github.com/filosottile/age) 是一个现代且安全的非对称加密工具。启用后，zip 文件将使用本项目的公钥加密，因此可以公开发布，例如发布在 GitHub issue 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**If I’ve defended your modern life, please consider sponsoring me.**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
